/* ============================================================
   LOYALTY PROGRAM (read-only plus manual adjustments; no schema changes)
   Balances use lazy expiry to match LoyaltyService.GetBalanceAsync:
   Earn rows with ExpiresAt in the past are excluded. Expiring-soon
